{"strings":["Declaration","Details related to any statement or action, in any form prescribed or accepted by the Government Agency, giving information or particulars required by the Governmental Agency.","Document acceptance date/time","Date and time of acceptance of a document in accordance with governmental legislation.","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","In the WCO Data Model the API Document identifier is mapped to Message function, coded instead of using the Document reference number.\n\nThe combination of Document Name Code and Document Identifier Code will result in:\n745  CP  Change Passenger Data\n745  XR  Cancel Reservation\n745  RP  Reduction in Party \n266  CL  Flight Close (only) Flight Close w/ identified Passengers not on-board \n266  CLOB  Flight Close w/ identified Passengers on-board\n266  XF  Cancel Flight\n266  CF  Change Flight/Itinerary\n250  CL  Crew Flight Close (only)\n250  CLNB Crew Flight Close w/ identified Crew not on-board \n250  CLOB  Crew Flight Close w/ identified Crew on-board","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","*Note: A gate pass is an authorization for a non-travelling person to access the sterile area of airports for the purpose of accompanying a ticketed traveller. (Presently used only in the United States.)","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Gross weight","Weight of goods including packing but excluding carrier's equipment.","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document name","Name of the additional document.","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","CurrencyExchange","Details related to rate at which one specified currency is expressed in another specified currency.","Currency code","Code specifying a monetary unit or currency.","CurrencyCodeList","DutyTaxFee","Details related to calculation of one instance of one duty, one tax, and/or one fee. \nComment: Each instance of this class is to be used for a single occurrence of duty, tax or fee.","Type of duty regime code","Code specifying a type of duty regime.","UN/EDIFACT code list 9213 OR User code list","GoodsShipment","Details related to the movement and the handling of goods shipped together on one or more means of transport between original consignor and final consignee.","Nature of transaction code","Code specifying the nature of a transaction associated with a shipment.","TransactionNatureTypeCodeList","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","Additional statement amount","Amount expressed on the additional statement.","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","ArrivalTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport at arrival.","Type of means of transport at arrival code","Code specifying means of transport used for the carriage of the goods at arrival.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","BorderTransportMeans","Details related to the means of transport crossing the border of the Customs territory.","First port of arrival in customs territory date/time","Date and time of arrival (actual or scheduled) of the means of transport at the first port (e.g. seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station).","Itinerary","Details related to the itinerary of the means of transport.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Country of routing code","Code specifying the country through which goods or passengers are routed between the country of original departure and final destination.","CountryCodeList","UnloadingLocation","Details related to the location at which the goods (i.e., consignment) are unloaded from the active means of transport having been used for their carriage.","Unloading location arrival date/time","Date and time of arrival at port or airport with the intent to unload.","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Address","Details related to an address.","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","User code list","CustomsValuation","Details related to valuation applying to the shipment.","Charges amount","Amount indicating the total cost of freight, insurance and all other costs and expenses from the foreign exit location to the entry location.","Freight costs amount","Amount indicating the total costs incurred by the shipper in moving goods, by whatever means, from one place to another under the terms of the contract of carriage. In addition to transport costs, this may include such elements as packing, documentation, loading, unloading, and insurance (i.e., to the extent that they relate to the freight cost).","DeliveryDestinationParty","Details related to the party to which goods are to be delivered.","Deliver to party name","Name of the party to which goods are to be delivered.","ExportCountry","Details related to the export country.","Country of exportation code","Code specifying  the country from which the goods are originally exported without any commercial transaction taken place in intermediate countries.","GoodsItem","Details related to the goods item as declared to Government Agency.","Customs amount","Amount declared for customs purposes of those goods in a consignment which are subject to the same customs procedure, and have the same tariff/statistical heading, country information and duty regime.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","InvoiceLine","Details related to the line item of an invoice.","Item amount","Amount due for each chargeable item of goods or services.","Net net weight","Weight of the goods themselves without any packing.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Shipping marks","Marks and or numbers on a transport unit or package.","UN/ECE Recommendation 15","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","Package dimension length","Length of the package.","Importer","Details related to the party who makes - or on whose behalf a customs clearing agent or other authorized person makes - an import declaration.","Importer name","Name of the party who makes, or on whose behalf a customs clearing agent or other authorized person makes, an import declaration. This may include a person who is in possession of the goods or to whom the goods are consigned.","Importer identifier","Identification of a party who makes, or on whose behalf a customs clearing agent or other authorized person makes, an import declaration. This may include a person who has possession of the goods or to whom the goods are consigned.","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Communication","Details related to communication including number and number type.","Communication identifier","Identification of the communication address.","Communication number type code","Code specifying the type of communication address.","CommunicationMeansTypeCodeList","UCR","Details related to the Unique Trader Reference such as Unique Consignment Reference (UCR).","Trader reference identifier","Identification of the number assigned by a declarant such as a trader reference or a carrier reference."],"root":{"s":"Declaration","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"42A","u":"0001D","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/Declaration","src":"BIP DEC:4","k":[{"s":"acceptance","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"AcceptanceDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D048","u":"0001D","q":"2","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/acceptanceDateTime","ub":["upu"],"src":"BIP DEC:5"},{"s":"function","n":4,"d":5,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"FunctionCode","f":"n..2","r":6,"w":"D046","u":"0001D","q":"6","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/documentFunctionCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/document-function-code-list","ln":7,"ub":["api","msw","sad","upu"],"src":"BIP DEC:9"},{"s":"identification","n":8,"d":9,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ID","